## 📱 Features Overview

| Category | Features |
|---|---|
| **Layout** | Mobile-first, fixed 430px max-width, sticky topbar, safe-area aware |
| **Home Screen** | Search bar, genre chips, featured banner, horizontal album scroll, track list |
| **Mini Player** | Floating above bottom nav, progress bar, prev/play/next controls |
| **Full Player** | Album art with pulse animation, seek bar, shuffle/repeat, volume slider, like/share/save/queue |
| **Interactions** | Play/pause toggle, track switching, seek by click, like tracks, shuffle mode, repeat mode |
| **Accessibility** | ARIA labels, roles, keyboard navigation (arrows to seek, Enter/Space to activate) |
| **Design** | Dark theme, purple accent, glassmorphism mini-player, gradient artwork, smooth transitions |

