## Key Output Components Explained

| Component | Description |
|---|---|
| **Class label** | What type of object was detected |
| **Confidence score** | How certain the model is (0–1) |
| **Bounding box** | Rectangle coordinates around the object |
| **Object ID** | Unique identifier per detection |
| **Attributes** | Optional extra info (color, motion, occlusion) |
| **Summary stats** | Aggregated counts and metrics |

---

## Notes on Typical Behavior
- Confidence **< 0.5** is usually filtered out
- **Overlapping boxes** are resolved via *Non-Maximum Suppression (NMS)*
- Partially hidden objects get **lower confidence** scores
- Real-time systems output this **per frame** (e.g., 30x/second)
